          "filename": "Bruntsfield Evangelical Church - geograph.org.uk - 1461929.jpg",
          "caption": "Bruntsfield Evangelical Church Bruntsfield Evangelical Church is in an old gothic church building at the corner of Leamington Terrace and Westhall Gardens, Edinburgh, EH10 \n4JU.  It's an autonomous church under no central authority.} It also has a new frontal area done in the last 2 years. A place to relax and chat. Church has differnt styles of worship. Most attended is the All age service. Most weeks it has just over 100 people at it.. It was bought in 1967. It was a Church of Scotland building before that.",
